<title>PORTUGAL: Banco Totta boosts 9-mth profit 5.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Banco Totta boosts 9-mth profit 5.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ending Sept 30</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	 16.74    vs     15.85</p>
<p>    Parent bank	     14.00    (up 2.5 pct)</p>
<p>    Cons cashflow	   45.12    vs     43.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  22.90    vs     20.44</p>
<p>    Minority interests     2.00    vs	1.73</p>
<p>    Provisions		16.74    vs     17.18</p>
<p>Note - Banco Totta &amp; Azores is company name.</p>
<p>The bank forms part of the Champalimaud group.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
